# Music Video Studio — MVP Definition

## Goal
A user can take their own song + video clips and produce a beat-synced music video they are proud to share, in under 30 minutes.

## Must-Have Features
- [ ] Import local video files and audio track
- [ ] Display audio waveform with beat markers
- [ ] Multi-track timeline (at least: main video, music, text)
- [ ] Trim and split clips
- [ ] Snap cuts to beats (manual or assisted)
- [ ] Add and style lyric/text overlays
- [ ] Real-time preview
- [ ] Export 1080p (16:9 and 9:16)

## Nice-to-Have (post-MVP)
- AI auto-edit / clipping
- Templates
- Color grading
- Green screen / background removal
- Keyframing
- Cloud project sync

## Success Criteria
- Timeline scrubbing feels responsive on mid-range devices
- Export completes without quality loss or sync issues
- User can complete a simple music video without external tools

## Constraints
- Music must be user-provided or licensed royalty-free
- On-device processing preferred for privacy and speed
